  <!-- Direct Answer Executive Summary -->
  <div class="direct-answer">
    <p><strong>Executive Summary:</strong> Chaincode is an automated Web3 assessment platform that prevents code plagiarism and credential spoofing in technical recruiting and hackathons. It passes submitted code through Google Gemini AI to analyze AST semantics, syntactic originality, and algorithmic complexity (achieving 95%+ classification accuracy). When code satisfies strict originality thresholds, an EVM smart contract mints an immutable ERC-721 Proof-of-Skill NFT to the developer's wallet.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Hard Quantitative Statistics -->
